  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "お待たせしすぎたのかもしれません  (Perhaps I Kept You Waiting Too Long)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "customer": "客"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Arriving late to a home appointment, Muranishi faces an annoyed client checking the clock. Instead of shrinking back, he delivers the line that becomes his lifelong trademark—turning his lateness into destiny and urging the room to decide right this instant. Listen to Muranishi at full power.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "遅いわよ。約束の時間が過ぎてる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "申し訳ございません。お待たせしすぎたのかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "人との出会いはすべてミラクルです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今決められないなら一生決められません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆様は毎日お忙しい日々を過ごしております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ストレートに言います！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はっきり言ってラストチャンスです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大勢の方がわたくしを待っているからです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これはわたくしの使命なんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ジャストナウ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "俺、買うよ。今か！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ご購入ありがとうございます。今しかありませんよ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Muranishi turns an ordinary sales visit into high theatre, culminating in his most famous catchphrase. Let's hear how each line lands.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "遅いわよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are late.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "約束の時間が過ぎてる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The appointment time has passed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "申し訳ございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am deeply sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせしすぎたのかもしれません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Perhaps I kept you waiting too long.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "人との出会いはすべてミラクルです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every meeting between people is a miracle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今決められないなら一生決められません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you cannot decide now, you will not decide in a lifetime.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はっきり言ってラストチャンスです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To put it plainly, this is your last chance!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これはわたくしの使命なんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is my mission!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ジャストナウ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "customer",
      "t": "俺、買うよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will buy it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今しかありませんよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is only right now!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
